<title>FRANCE: Canal Plus 1996 turnover 11.59 bln Ffr.</title>
<headline>Canal Plus 1996 turnover 11.59 bln Ffr.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-02-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to Dec 31, 1996.</p>
<p>(All figures in millions of French francs)</p>
<p>    Turnover					11,585    vs   10,157</p>
<p>	- subscriptions			    8,901    vs    8,182</p>
<p>	- advertising and sponsorship	    440    vs	455</p>
<p>	- other goods and services		2,244   vs    1,520</p>
<p>NOTE - Canal Plus gave its turnover figures in a statement. It said turnover rose 14.1 percent over the prior year and was up 9.9 percent on a like-for-like basis, excluding UGC DA which was consolidated in the second half.</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom +33 1 4221 5452</p>
</text>
